+## Usage
+
+Start with [the site guide](site/README.md) for the current website and its `@ejm/*` dependencies. [The design kit](design-kit/README.md), [site reference](design-kit/SITES.md), and [application reference](design-kit/UI.md) retain the earlier kit and brand assets. `x-kit/` contains the social profile kit. `ejmlabs-design-kit.zip` is generated by the site build into `site/dist` and is not a committed release.
+
+## Development
+
+```sh
+node design-kit/scripts/build-ui.mjs
+node design-kit/scripts/build-ui.mjs --check
+node design-kit/scripts/check-kit.mjs
+npm --prefix site test
+npm --prefix site run build
+```
+
+Use the OpenSpec workflow for feature and bugfix changes. Keep generated assets and their source definitions consistent. Human admission controls CI and AI runs; see the contributor guide. A successful local build does not deploy the site.
